		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I only knew Maha for a short while.  He was joined with my sister &#8220;Donna&#8221; in spiritual marriage in 2009.  His presence was very calm and his laughter infectious.  I know he &#8220;passed through&#8221; doing what meant alot to him.  I was just blessed to have walked the same path with him for just a short while.  His earthly presence will be missed by those who shared a connection with him. Continue on with your journey Maha&#8230;..</p>
]]></content:encoded>
